```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #333;
            color: #fff;
            transition: background-color 0.5s ease;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #444;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .section h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .section p {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .cta {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .cta button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            background-color: #555;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .cta button:hover {
            background-color: #666;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Portfolio</h1>
            <p>Tech Support Guy with 4+ years of experience and currently researching AI.</p>
        </div>
        <section class="section" id="about">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>I am a tech support guy with over four years of experience in providing technical assistance to clients. I have a strong background in problem-solving and troubleshooting, and I am always looking for ways to improve my skills.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="section" id="research">
            <h2>Research</h2>
            <p>I am currently researching AI and its applications in various industries. My goal is to contribute to the development of new technologies that can help solve complex problems and improve people's lives.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="cta">
            <button onclick="downloadResume()">Download Resume</button>
            <button onclick="sendEmail()">Send Email</button>
            <button onclick="contributeToGithub()">Contribute to Github</button>
            <button onclick="contributeMoney()">Contribute Money</button>
        </section>
    </div>
    <script>
        function downloadResume() {
            const link = document.createElement('a');
            link.href = 'resume.pdf';
            link.download = 'resume.pdf';
            link.click();
        }

        function sendEmail() {
            window.location.href = 'mailto:your-email@example.com?subject=Portfolio Inquiry';
        }

        function contributeToGithub() {
            window.open('https://github.com/username', '_blank');
        }

        function contributeMoney() {
            // Implement payment processing here
            alert('Thank you for your contribution!');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```